# Simple Elevators Localization - Git attributes

# Default: detect text, normalize to LF in the repo
* text=auto eol=lf

# Language files: force UTF-8 and LF line endings
*.lang text eol=lf working-tree-encoding=UTF-8

# JSON files (languages.json, etc.)
*.json text eol=lf

# Markdown docs
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary assets (if any)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ogg binary